  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the latest update with Phys bones the _Stretch parameter is extremely jittery when it is affecting bones of itself.\n\nMy example is my tail. When I pull on it with _Stretch it scales it up to 3.0 max size.\n\nThis is the current behavior (pardon the twitter links)\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Juzo_VR/status/1655409185163472897?s=20\n\nThis is the old behavior. It used to be very smooth and work fantastically.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Juzo_VR/status/1655409308811632640?s=20\n\nHere are the settings I have for the tail. \n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/I6aMFnm.png\n\nThe middle settings dont matter. Just the stretch.\n\nBlend tree for scaling the tail off of the _Stretch\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/attjrt9.png\n\nZero stretch\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/duEXmll.png\n\nFull Stretch\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/SFSaK8c.png\n\nAvatar ID you can use to test\n\navtr_4bc1b14c-c809-4c8b-890c-f39cd6656767 if I need to make it public let me know",
